---
# Inherits the root .clang-tidy and turns off one check for the tests only.
#
# readability-identifier-naming is clean across src/ and enforced there. The 43
# violations that remain are all in five test files, so disabling it here keeps
# the convention enforced where the library lives instead of losing it entirely
# to test-only debt. Fix those files, then delete this file — the count and the
# file list are in coso#190.
#
# Note this costs the tests no other coverage: every other check the root config
# enables still applies to them.
InheritParentConfig: true
Checks: >
  -readability-identifier-naming
